Nice day!



This is Dorothy of WellSucceed Embroidery Limited.



WellSucceed Embroidery Limited is a professional merchandise supplier with
over 20 years history. We set up our embroidery factory in 2001. We supply
custom made merchandise for many world-famous companies.



We offer all kinds of custom-made merchandise, including clothing,
headwear, bags, toys, patches, flags, wristbands, socks, water bottles,
beach towels, blankets, guitar picks, felt slip mats, metal herb grinders,
vinyl wood/metal boxes, puzzles, tattoo stickers, etc.



We can produce hoodies and snapback hats with 3D embroidery, metallic
embroidery, Glow in The Dark embroidery, Reflective embroidery, chenille
embroidery, sequin embroidery, tuft stitches embroidery, etc.



We can produce T shirts with discharge printing, puff printing,
tie dye printing, digital printing, 3D printing, embroidery on printing,
printing&embossing logos, etc.



We can produce extra-large backpatches made in embroidery, woven, printing.
We can also produce extra size flags, tapestries, curtains.



If you give orders over 100pcs of hoodies, t shirts, flags, snapback hats,
beach towels, blankets, you can get 100pcs patches free.



We are professional. Work with us in 2022, we'll succeed.



Looking forward to your reply.



Thanks and best regards,



Dorothy
